# Marketplace Legal

# Purpose

The Legal repository is the Marketplace's legal, compliance, governance, and policy source of truth.

# Responsibilities

- Marketplace Terms
- Customer Terms
- Professional Terms
- Privacy and Cookie Policies
- Payment, Escrow, Refund, and Withdrawal Policies
- Dispute and Safety Policies
- Communication, Call, and Masked-Number Policies
- Professional Verification Policy
- Data Protection and Regional Compliance
- Security and Incident Policies
- Intellectual Property Policies
- Admin Governance
- Contracts and Legal Templates
- Legal Review and Policy Versioning

# Integration

- customer-app → customer terms, privacy, cookies, refunds
- professional-app → professional terms, verification, withdrawals, service rules
- admin-dashboard → admin governance and compliance
- payment-service → payment, escrow, refund, withdrawal policies
- communication-service → communication, calls, masked numbers, retention
- notification-service → consent and communication preferences
- database → retention and data-protection requirements
- security → security and incident requirements

# Boundaries

Legal documentation and compliance only.

No application code, backend logic, database schemas, UI/UX, payment processing, authentication, Twilio implementation, or infrastructure configuration.

# Compliance

Support applicable laws and regulations across supported countries, including GDPR, NDPA, and regional requirements.

# Change Management

All legal changes require review, approval, versioning, effective dates, and change history.

